# Industry template packages (FI 5). A pack installs every library template in the categories it lists plus any extra template keys.
# Every pack carries the same CAPA set (report, action plan, root cause worksheet, effectiveness check and log).
pack automotive | Automotive | Advanced product quality planning, production part approval with a shared data page and characteristics list, process FMEA, control plan, validation, first article, first pass yield, run at rate and launch readiness templates. | APQP; PPAP | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log; eight-d-package; ncr-log; supplier-change-notification; supplier-deviation-request; receiving-inspection; final-inspection; layered-process-audit
pack aerospace | Aerospace | First article inspection, configuration control and process verification templates. | FAI; CONFIGURATION | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log; ncr-log; eight-d-package; receiving-inspection
pack medical-device | Medical device | Design history file, device master record, device history record, validation and CAPA templates. | DESIGN_DEVICE | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log; ncr-log; complaint-intake; recall-assessment; supplier-qualification
pack electronics | Electronics | ESD control, moisture sensitive devices, reflow profiles, board workmanship, first pass yield, counterfeit parts and CAPA templates for electronics manufacturers. | | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log; ncr-log; ncr-internal; receiving-inspection; final-inspection; supplier-scorecard; eight-d-package
pack manufacturing | Manufacturing | Nonconformance, CAPA, audit, calibration and supplier quality templates. | NONCONFORMANCE; AUDIT; CALIBRATION; SUPPLIER | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log
